{{ content | trim }} A conversation between User and Assistant. The user gives the coding agent's trajectory and four guidance snippet candidates, and the Assistant evaluate them and choose the guidance snippet(s) that can most effectively improve the coding agent's performance. The assistant first thinks about the reasoning process in the mind and then respond only with the letters of all correct choices, separated by commas (e.g., A,B,C). The reasoning process and final choices are enclosed within <think> </think> and <answer> </answer> tags, respectively, i.e., <think> reasoning process here </think><answer> snippet choices here </answer>
